@*
    Account deletion page. Google Play requires a web link where people can
    delete their account without the app - this page's address goes in the
    Play Console ("Delete account URL").
*@

<section class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
        <h1>Delete your ShiftingGuru account</h1>

        <p class="legal-intro">
            You can delete your ShiftingGuru account at any time. Deleting it permanently removes your account
            and everything in it. It can't be undone.
        </p>

        <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
        <p>
            Your account, mobile number, email and city; all your moving requests, including ones made on this
            website with the same mobile number; every quote on those requests; any reviews you wrote; and your
            notification settings.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you have a booked move that isn't complete yet, please finish it, or cancel it with your partner
            and tell us, before deleting.
        </p>

        <h2>Option 1: In the app (fastest)</h2>
        <p>
            Open the ShiftingGuru app, go to <strong>Profile &rarr; Delete account</strong>, enter your password
            and confirm. Your account is deleted straight away.
        </p>

        <h2>Option 2: Ask us</h2>
        <p>
            If you can't use the app, email
            <a href="mailto:rahul@goyalcarcarrier.com?subject=Delete%20my%20ShiftingGuru%20account">rahul@goyalcarcarrier.com</a>
            with the subject <strong>"Delete my ShiftingGuru account"</strong>, from the email address on your
            account, and include your registered mobile number.
        </p>
        <p>
            To protect you, we may call that number to confirm the request is really yours. We delete the
            account within 30 days and email you when it's done.
        </p>

        <h2>Partners</h2>
        <p>
            Partner accounts are managed by our team. To close a partner account, email
            <a href="mailto:rahul@goyalcarcarrier.com">rahul@goyalcarcarrier.com</a> from your registered email,
            with your application number (it starts with SG-V-).
        </p>

        <p class="legal-see-also">See also our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    /* Scoped to this page only, so it can't affect the rest of the site. */
    .legal-page { padding: 48px 20px 72px; background: #F7F9FC; }
    .legal-container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; color: #17233D; line-height: 1.7; }
    .legal-page h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #17233D; }
    .legal-page h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 32px 0 8px; color: #17233D; }
    .legal-page p { margin: 0 0 12px; color: #334155; }
    .legal-page a { color: #315DCE; }
    .legal-intro { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #17233D !important; }
    .legal-see-also { margin-top: 40px !important; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #E5EAF2; }
</style>